                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-01-12"><hi rendition="#italic">January 12,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Law putting new agreements in force read in Cortes to-day. Leader opposition,
                    Canovas, says no objection will be made.</p>
            </div>
